[00:08.04]1. Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:13.94]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:21.22]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:26.56]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:35.04]By his love God made provision;
[00:40.00]We may freely take his hand.
[00:46.34]So we make our dedication;
[00:52.22]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[00:58.26]2. In this day of Satan’s anger,
[01:04.16]As the end is drawing ever near,
[01:11.60]We are faced with opposition
[01:17.60]That could make us turn away in fear.
[01:25.34]But Jehovah gives protection;
[01:31.14]Close to him we want to stay,
[01:37.68]That we might forever serve him.
[01:43.92]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:54.38]3. Help for us God has provided
[02:00.44]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[02:07.18]Through the Christian congregation,
[02:13.26]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[02:20.76]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[02:26.54]He will help us do what’s right.
[02:32.82]He will help us to be loyal
[02:38.64]And walk modestly in his sight.
